@Ice_DecodeLoop Ice_DecodeLoop() : main Pack-Ice 2.x decoding loop (register based: a5 = packed data read backwards, a6 = output
@Ice_DecodeLoop written backwards, a4 = output start, d7 = bit buffer). Copies literal runs, then decodes back-references (L_03a14) until done.
F_039f8 Ice_GetBit
@Ice_GetBit Ice_GetBit() : shifts the next bit of the Ice bit stream into the X/C flags, refilling d7 from -(a5) when empty.
F_03a02 Ice_GetBits
@Ice_GetBits d1 = Ice_GetBits(d0 = count - 1) : reads d0+1 bits from the Ice bit stream into d1.
F_03ab8 Packer_AtomikDepack
@Packer_AtomikDepack Packer_AtomikDepack(a0 = data) : Atomik 3.5 ("ATM5") in-place depacker, used by Packer_Depack. Does nothing if the
@Packer_AtomikDepack header is not "ATM5".
F_03b5c Packer_AtomikGetBits
@Packer_AtomikGetBits d5 = Packer_AtomikGetBits(d6 = count - 1) : reads bits from the Atomik bit stream (d7 buffer, refilled from -(a6)).
F_03c64 Packer_AtomikCopyBack
@Packer_AtomikCopyBack Packer_AtomikCopyBack(d0 = size, a5 = source, a6 = dest) : copies (size/16 + 1) blocks of 16 bytes; used at the end of
@Packer_AtomikCopyBack Packer_AtomikDepack to move the depacked data into place.

